    "rawHtml": "<div class=\"xl:max-w-screen-xl pt-6 md:pt-12 pb-6 lg:pb-10 mx-auto px-6 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:pt-24\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900\">\n        Eco-Friendly Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags\n    </h1>\n    <div class=\"prose prose-lg lg:prose-xl xl:prose-2xl\">\n        These reusable silicone food storage bags are a must-have for\n        anyone looking to reduce their environmental impact and save money in the long run.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex gap-4 flex-wrap my-4 md:mt-8\">\n        <a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 transition ease-in-out duration-150 text-base text-white px-4 lg:px-8 py-4 inline-block font-bold rounded-md shadow-xl\">Start\n            Browse\n        </a>\n\n        <a href=\"\"\n            class=\"bg-white hover:bg-yellow-200 text-base text-indigo-600 px-4 lg:px-8 py-4 inline-block font-bold rounded-md shadow-xl transition ease-in-out duration-150\">\n            Our impact\n        </a>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"\" class=\"font-semibold mt-6 inline-block text-lg lg:text-xl text-indigo-600 hover:underline\"><span\n            class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Discover our key features. »</span>\n        <span class=\"inline sm:hidden\">Learn more »</span>\n    </a>\n</div>"
